" y=\"760\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">whole &#955; apart &#8594; bright band</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">half &#955; apart &#8594; dark band</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"910\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">0, 1&#955;, 2&#955;... bright | &#189;&#955;, 1&#189;&#955;... dark</text></svg>",
