      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Quick Check</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What makes g-2 so special?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"200\" width=\"800\" height=\"110\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#6366f1\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Step 1: Dirac (1928)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">g = 2 exactly</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"345\" width=\"800\" height=\"110\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"395\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Step 2: QED virtual-particle cloud</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">nudges g just above 2</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"490\" width=\"800\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.14)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"545\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Step 3: theory vs experiment</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"590\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">agree to ~12 significant figures</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"670\" width=\"600\" height=\"120\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.10)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"725\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Unmatched by any other theory</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"765\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">= QED, the gold standard</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Precision is the ultimate test -- and QED passes like nothing else.</text></svg>"
