      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">Keep Learning</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">Four ways to go deeper</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"180\" width=\"880\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#6366f1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">1</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"245\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial\">Play with a real qubit</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\" font-family=\"Arial\">free simulators and cloud quantum computers</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"350\" width=\"880\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"440\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">2</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"415\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial\">Read one great book</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"455\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\" font-family=\"Arial\">Carroll, Gribbin, or Aaronson</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"520\" width=\"880\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"610\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">3</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"585\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial\">Ponder a real puzzle</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"625\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\" font-family=\"Arial\">collapse? many worlds? black hole info?</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"690\" width=\"880\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"780\" font-size=\"44\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">4</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"755\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial\">Explain one idea to someone</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"795\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#888\" font-family=\"Arial\">teaching is how it hardens into knowledge</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">The second act is being written now. Join it.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Four concrete habits, from playing with a simulator to teaching a friend, that keep you inside the living quantum story."
